Description: Update CEF's chrome_browser_frame_mac.patch for Chromium 147
 CEF's chrome_browser_frame_mac.patch contains full git index hashes that may
 not match Debian's patched Chromium source. Shortening the index hashes makes
 the patch more robust when applied to Debian Chromium where git hashes differ.
 .
 The refactoring (adding static methods with Browser* parameter) and null-check
 patterns (browser_view_ ? browser_view_->browser() : nullptr) are already
 present in CEF 147 upstream.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-04-10

